From 89330639da43c70bf60ad34d008987dd22206676 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 06:02:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ImsStack: build against Android 15 (LineageOS 22.2)

Four telephony APIs ImsStack uses arrived after Android 15. Every other
framework API it needs is already present on Android 15 QPR2, hidden or
flagged, so these are the only source changes needed to compile against
LineageOS 22.2's framework:

- TelephonyManager#requestUiccIari (17): report no IARIs, as a failed
  request does. Only RCS reads them.
- BarringInfo#getCellIdentity (17): read the CellIdentity back from the
  parcel; BarringInfo writes it first.
- TelephonyManager#EXTRA_SETUP_EVENT_LIST (17): local constant. Android 15
  never sends the broadcast it belongs to.
- TelephonyCallback.DomainSelectionEmergencyModeListener (16): not
  registered; domain-selection emergency mode is not reported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
